### Authentication Security

- Hash passwords using a suitable password-hashing algorithm.
- Implement secure authentication and session handling.
- Enforce authorization on backend API endpoints.
- Protect against unauthorized record access.
- Add input validation, rate limiting and security headers.
- Implement secure password reset.
- Never expose credentials or secrets in frontend code.
- Never hardcode production admin passwords.
- Do not trust frontend-only role checks.
- Use HTTPS in production.

